// Lets a non-player entity (e.g. Lux's sentry gun) be seen by Input-consuming systems (WeaponSystem)
// the same way a real player is, without an actual PlayerLink/PlayerRef behind it - some other
// system (the entity's own "brain", e.g. SentryBarrelSystem) writes into Data every tick in the
// same Input shape a real player's input uses. WeaponSystem itself no longer reads Fire.IsDown out
// of Data (firing is auto-attack, gated on Aim.Target instead - see WeaponSystem.HasFireDriver) but
// still requires either this component or PlayerLink to exist before a Weapon is allowed to fire.
component InputSource
{
    Input Data;
}
